  "evidence": "The assistant claims \"'The Tunnel' (Der Tunnel)\" is a crime novel by Dürrenmatt, whereas the reference states \"plays include Der Besuch der alten Dame (1956) and Die Physiker (1962)\" and lists \"Der Tunnel\" as a play, not a crime novel."
